      "imageWidth": 746,
      "imageHeight": 1000,
      "story": "Portrait of Sarah Bernhardt is an oil on canvas painting by French painter Jules Bastien-Lepage, from 1879. It portrays the famous actress Sarah Bernhardt, who had a mutual admiration for Bastien-Lepage. It is held in a private collection.",
      "facts": [
        "This portrait reached the highest price in the art market for a Bastien-Lepage painting, when it sold for $2,280,000 at Christie's on 20 October 2022.",
